{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"GREEN. All acceptance criteria evidenced.\n\nAC1 — canary passes against the real audited binary:\n  PATH=…:/tmp/tfci-bin REBAR_TERRAFORM_CONFIG_INSPECT_CANARY=1 \\\n    pytest tests/unit/grounding/test_terraform_corroborator.py -k pinned_upstream_canary\n  -> 1 passed, 24 deselected in 42.13s\n  (pre-fix, same command, same binary: AssertionError: assert 'abstain' == 'match')\n\nAC2 — schema now validates the real tool: scripted iter_errors against one real\n  `terraform-config-inspect --json .` document reports 0 violations (was 15).\n\nAC3 — `_run` passes \".\" and the child's cwd remains the snapshot: the updated\n  subprocess-contract test asserts `capture[\"argv\"][1:] == [\"--json\", \".\"]` and that the child's\n  cwd basename starts with `.rebar-tfci-`, and it keeps the existing\n  `not any(str(repo) in arg for arg in capture[\"argv\"])` no-leak assertion — which the change\n  strengthens, since the snapshot path is no longer in argv at all.\n\nAC4 — the second link was independently necessary. With the schema corrected but the ABSOLUTE\n  directory argument left in place, against the real binary:\n      schema fix ALONE -> abstain / path_outside_snapshot\n  So neither change alone is sufficient; the chain needed both.\n\nAC5 — regression: `pytest tests/unit/grounding/ -q` -> 366 passed, 1 skipped.\n  `make verify` on the three-commit stack running before push.\n\nTEETH (seeded defect): re-seeding ONLY the absolute directory argument\n(`[str(exe), \"--json\", str(snapshot)]`) returns the canary to\n`AssertionError: assert 'abstain' == 'match'`; restoring `\".\"` returns it to green. The canary\nwas not softened — it still refuses to pass on abstain."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788613192087766772,"uuid":"02ddaa2b-eb6b-42b5-baab-1f2215f3416d"}